                                "sense_id": "d8e34d91-f2a9-395d-9c29-6ddca59b2e52",
                                "text": "I was straightways undone at the thought of Momma and Sarah Obis rattled around inside the flying tin can like a couple rag dolls."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f2fde61-c5dd-4219-9c43-8105af8cb19f",
                                "sense_id": "d8e34d91-f2a9-395d-9c29-6ddca59b2e52",
                                "text": "[…] he was straightways received into favour, and heard these most comfortable words at the mouth of Christ:"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "860e7df7-4b31-47a2-b986-2f7901911f4c",
                                "sense_id": "d8e34d91-f2a9-395d-9c29-6ddca59b2e52",
                                "text": "I accepted this compromise against my will, but was straightways thrown into despair as I saw the swimmers up above, on the evening of our singing, making the most unsuitable movements and doleful or indifferent faces […]"
                            }
                        ]
